Each hypothesis is one scope line the seller agreed to deliver, as written in the scope document; value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Agreed order form",
      "text": "Seller: Imeri Leatherworks, Nigeria\nBuyer: Navo Trading\nGoods: leather sandals\nAgreed total: USD 240, including delivery\n\nRequirements:\n1. Deliver 10 pairs of brown leather sandals.\n2. Include 10 cotton storage bags.\n3. Use vegetable-tanned leather for every sandal upper.\n4. Attach a care card to each pair.\n\nThe buyer confirmed these requirements before production. The seller will pack all items together for handover to the buyer's representative. The price covers the listed goods and packing; no separate customization was requested. Both parties agreed that the care cards and bags would accompany the sandals rather than follow in a separate shipment."
    },
    {
      "title": "Handover note",
      "text": "Imeri Leatherworks handover to Navo Trading's representative\nGoods: leather sandal order, USD 240\n\nThe representative and seller opened the carton together and counted its contents. Their joint count was: 10 pairs of brown leather sandals; no cotton storage bags; care cards attached to 6 of the 10 pairs. The four remaining pairs had no cards in the carton. The carton was then closed and handed over.\n\nThe representative accepted the carton as counted, without confirming what tanning process was used for the leather. No material certificate was included with this note. Both parties retained a copy of the count for reference."
    },
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat after handover",
      "text": "10:14 Navo Trading: We checked the carton after our representative brought it back. The count on the handover note is right.\n10:18 Imeri Leatherworks: Thanks for checking. I will review what happened with the packing materials.\n10:21 Navo Trading: Please let us know when you have an update. We need to plan how to present the sandals to our customers.\n10:26 Imeri Leatherworks: Understood. I have asked the packing team to look into it and will message you when I have their response.\n10:29 Navo Trading: All right. For now we are keeping the carton and its contents together."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Deliver 10 pairs of brown leather sandals.",
